#: src/index.md
msgid ""
"ページ（HTML）の置き場のサーバー。置かれたページを DB（SQLite）に持ち、番号を"
"付け、絞って探せる一覧の UI を出す。 この Mac の中（`127.0.0.1`）だけで使う物"
"で、[skills](https://github.com/uraitakahito/skills) の `tpm page` の命令が、"
"ここの API を `curl` で呼ぶ。"
msgstr ""
"A page store server for pages (HTML). It keeps the pages put into it in a DB "
"(SQLite), assigns them numbers, and serves a list UI that can be filtered "
"and searched. It is used only from this Mac (`127.0.0.1`), and the `tpm "
"page` command of [skills](https://github.com/uraitakahito/skills) calls its "
"endpoints with `curl`."

#: src/index.md
msgid ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart LR\n"
"  tpm[\"skills の tpm page<br>（curl）\"] -->|\"POST・GET・DELETE /api/"
"pages\"| srv\n"
"  browser[\"browser\"] -->|\"一覧の UI・ページの本文\"| srv\n"
"  subgraph mac[\"この Mac（127.0.0.1 だけ）\"]\n"
"    srv[\"pagetray<br>（container）\"] --> db[(\"SQLite<br>volume pagetray-"
"data\")]\n"
"  end\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```mermaid\n"
"flowchart LR\n"
"  tpm[\"tpm page in skills<br>(curl)\"] -->|\"POST, GET, DELETE /api/"
"pages\"| srv\n"
"  browser[\"browser\"] -->|\"list UI, page bodies\"| srv\n"
"  subgraph mac[\"This Mac (127.0.0.1 only)\"]\n"
"    srv[\"pagetray<br>(container)\"] --> db[(\"SQLite<br>volume pagetray-"
"data\")]\n"
"  end\n"
"```"

