"割）」"
msgstr ""
"The name of the role of whoever put the page (such as `tpm` or `human`). The "
"heading in the UI reads \"Assignee (role)\""

#: src/glossary.md
msgid "workspace"
msgstr "workspace"

#: src/glossary.md
