"ない（狭い画面では、区画が縦に積まれるため）。区画を足す時も、同じ形で名を付"
"け、ここに 1 行足す。"
msgstr ""
"The regions are named by **function + shape** (bar, column, frame). They are "
"not named by position (top, left, right), because on a narrow screen the "
"regions stack vertically. When adding a region, name it in the same form and "
"add a row here."

#: src/glossary.md
